# Reference screenshots pasted into chat land here under whatever name the attachment step gives
# them (image.png, image2.png, a typo'd iamge.png, ...) — never a name worth guessing in advance.
# vsce matches .vscodeignore patterns with minimatch, not gitignore rules: a leading "/" would need
# a literal leading "/" in the file's own relative path (which it never has) to match at all, so
# this is deliberately un-anchored — bare "*.png" already can't cross a "/" in minimatch, so it
# still only matches root-level files, leaving the real shipped assets/icon.png alone.
*.png
@eaDir/**
